# A planted ledger: a row for the throw, a row for the class, and each runtime symbol of the planted
# configuration.  The rule judges the symbols of each build, so a control of the throws and the classes holds its
# symbols too.
format 1
rule artifact-symbols
configuration planted kind planted
configuration planted tier planted
@build/libcrucible.a | ratchet | 1 | _ZTIi | -
@build/libcrucible.a | ratchet | 1 | __cxa_allocate_exception | -
@build/libcrucible.a | ratchet | 1 | __cxa_throw | -
@build/libcrucible.a | throw | admit | admitted_throwing_entry | a planted throw
@build/libfoundation.a | allow | 1 | __cxa_guard_acquire | -
@build/libfoundation.a | allow | 1 | __cxa_guard_release | -
@build/libfoundation.a | ratchet | 1 | _ZTVN10__cxxabiv117__class_type_infoE | -
@build/libfoundation.a | ratchet | 1 | _ZdlPvm | -
@build/libfoundation.a | vtable | admit | Admitted | a planted class
